From e1d65e02730a9df2cbf199038c2c8f3a53e4618c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] Lay out workbench, Explorer, tabs, breadcrumbs, and
 scrollbars like VS Code

Consolidates the VS Code Dracula activity bar, Explorer with Outline
section (expanding folders_expanded on F2 rename), floating card layout,
connected tabs, path-boundary-safe breadcrumbs, VS Code scrollbars, and
active-tab-first parallel workspace restoration with async toolchains.
